  },
  {
   "id": "A08-description",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 14,
   "y": 1836,
   "width": 612,
   "height": 70.0,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#33475b",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 1000,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 1,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "每个电流点在按预估线圈常数算出的预测中心\n±FREQUENCY_HALF_WIDTH_HZ 扫频；主磁场开启时全程不过零，关闭时按\n|K(I−I0)| 过零处理；预测 |中心| 低于零场下限的点只测电流；R\n坏点超门槛重采；需要粗测时把半宽/步进调大单独跑一轮",
   "originalText": "每个电流点在按预估线圈常数算出的预测中心\n±FREQUENCY_HALF_WIDTH_HZ 扫频；主磁场开启时全程不过零，关闭时按\n|K(I−I0)| 过零处理；预测 |中心| 低于零场下限的点只测电流；R\n坏点超门槛重采；需要粗测时把半宽/步进调大单独跑一轮",
   "fontSize": 14,
   "fontFamily": 1,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "baseline": 14,
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
